        <p>ST T. ANBES.—Superior FURNISHED HOUSE To Be Lt until April; grainer&amp; a week.--Y. MILLPiax, 3.lansfield rd., Bradford. IV-EMBERS PARLIAMENT recommend their Board _L r eeldence or Apartments, 19 Castleton rd., West Kensington, London].</p>
